    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can use your ability to circumvent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Behavioral_Inhibitors\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Behavioral Inhibitors\">Behavioral Inhibitors</a> to temporarily break the programming of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> that you have a data link with. Make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check opposed by the Droid's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. Breaking the Droid's programming overrides its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Behavioral_Inhibitors\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Behavioral Inhibitors\">Behavioral Inhibitors</a> for a number of rounds equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> bonus.",
